      "stem": "閱讀以下校園英語廣播社的專訪對話，依據「句子骨架與現在簡單式規則」選出最符合語法的選項填入空格：\nHost: Welcome back to Sunny Junior High Radio! Leo, tell us about your twin brother, Max. Do you two share the same weekend routine?\nLeo: Not really! I love sports, so I play basketball every Saturday morning. Max is very quiet. He ______ sports at all, and he usually ______ in the town library all afternoon.",
