      "title": "【會考情境時態對比原型題】下課走廊尋人：平時習慣與當下進行動作雙句切換",
      "stem": "閱讀以下兩位同學在下課時間的走廊對話，綜合「平時習慣與當下現場情境」選出語法與拼字完全正確的選項：\nKevin: Hey, Nina! Where are Sam and Toby? They usually ______ table tennis in the gym during the break, but the table is empty right now.\nNina: Shh! Look through the window of Classroom 702. They ______ a birthday card for Ms. Lin with the other classmates at this moment!",
