          "content": "段考與會考誘答選項最常利用「Do not use plural verbs with this/that. In negative imperatives, use \"Don’t\" + base verb, never \"Not\" or \"No\" (say \"Don’t touch\", not \"No touch\").」設下陷阱。作答完畢後，請務必執行本課專屬逆向檢核：「完整更正為 These are three boxes of milk. Don’t put them here.。對照 This is a box of milk.：一盒時 this、is、a box 都為單數。box 的複數是 boxes；不能只改 are 而忘記指示詞或名詞」，並對照遷移任務「Write four signs for your school library using polite positive and negative imperatives.」確認邏輯閉環。實戰秘訣：核對本點實例與界線：She looks happy.（happy 為形容詞補語）；He became a teacher.。"
