      "stem": "閱讀以下森林生態園區解說員向遊客說明瀑布步道路線的對話，選出最符合空間位置與移動方向介系詞文法的選項填入空格 (1)、(2)、(3)：\nGuide: Welcome to Green Valley Nature Park! Before we set off, please look at the trail map ____(1)____ the wooden notice board beside you. To reach Rainbow Waterfall, first walk carefully ____(2)____ the narrow stone bridge over the stream, and then hike straight ____(3)____ a cool, dark bamboo tunnel for about five minutes. Right after you step out of the tunnel, you will see the waterfall right in front of you!",
